# Reverse-engineering artifacts.
#   * RE notes we write ourselves (`.md`) are tracked — including
#     docs/research/re/ — so future-us can build on them.
#   * Raw decompiled C from Ghidra is NOT tracked (it's derived output;
#     the .md notes are the authored artifact).
#   * docs/research/re/game-*.tsv ARE tracked: addresses, sizes, imports,
#     calls exported by tools/ghidra/import.sh (facts, not code). Not the
#     strings: those are game.exe's own bytes (LEGAL.md).
tools/ghidra/gdt/
tools/ghidra/project/
*.c.ghidra
*.decomp.c
docs/research/re/*.c
docs/research/re/game-strings.tsv

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store

# Python
__pycache__/
